     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\">Good morning,  <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\">I am wondering if there is something wrong in a variable of GGIR part5 summary file.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\">For  &quot;dur_TINday_min&quot;, when I check this variable among 3000\r\nsamples,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\">quantile(as.numeric(data[,&quot;dur_TINday_min&quot;]),na.rm=T)/60<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\">         0%       \r\n 25%         50%       \r\n 75%        100%<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\"> 0.01805556 10.11944444 12.10000000 14.12708333 30.79166667\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\">it looks weird since it could be larger than 24 /25 hours.  </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\">May I get help on this issue?</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\">Thanks.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\">Best,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#2f5597\">Dora</span></p></div>"
